## 2. Product Development Cost Estimation (CapEx)

Migrating the legacy system requires mapping out the 10+ core CodeIgniter controller operations to .NET Core Controllers, DTOs, and Services, and developing corresponding React views. The estimated schedule is **120 development days** due to the architectural setup and strong-typing boilerplate.

We compare two realistic market models below:
- **Model A (Senior Full-Stack Developer)**: Single senior developer contract model. Rate estimated at **₹12,000 / day (~$145/day)**.
- **Model B (Digital Agency Team)**: Team model including PM, C# Backend Dev, React Dev, UI/UX Designer, and QA. Rate estimated at **₹30,000 / day (~$360/day)**.

